[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 5115.27, "timestamp": "01:25:15", "text": "我想我們只能這麼做了。我去學習技能和港口。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5117.83, "timestamp": "01:25:17", "text": "哦，是的。需要作品集，對吧？我覺得"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5120.709, "timestamp": "01:25:20", "text": "即使是音樂方面，我也真的需要有作品集之類的東西，對吧？  哦，對了，瀑布是主要景觀。  我最初是想把我的 YouTube 頻道當作作品集來展示的，因為我要去日本"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5128.149, "timestamp": "01:25:28", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5140.229, "timestamp": "01:25:40", "text": "不，我是在大學畢業後，拿到"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5143.03, "timestamp": "01:25:43", "text": "正式的學分等等之後，然後我就以為 YouTube 是來自日本的。所以，如果我能進入娛樂產業工作，例如"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5145.35, "timestamp": "01:25:45", "text": "配音員或其他與 YouTube 相關的工作，那就太好了。  但我現在做不到了。  呃，我再也做不到了。我不能把我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5147.51, "timestamp": "01:25:47", "text": "頻道"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5157.03, "timestamp": "01:25:57", "text": "當成作品集，因為很遺憾，我的"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 5157.13, "timestamp": "01:25:57", "author": "@Surya_VT", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/xYZGMsDSkF4w1IOdT2xKmMHI-M3-NParGStQvKERjxxwivecaInz95y5n8jliQSZ7SgMMYzdrw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "btw ya can voice for Indian character or dark screen characters"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5159.27, "timestamp": "01:25:59", "text": "紀錄不好"}]